+---
+id: task-001-implement-rfc-6901-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+The function must implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer evaluation, returning the referenced JSON value and
+throwing for malformed pointers or pointers that cannot resolve within the supplied document. Add
+documentation and tests that cover object members, array indexes, escape decoding, the root pointer,
+and invalid or unresolved pointers.
